      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Ragha Video Inspector\n\n1. Pick a video in Load Video and press Run.\n2. The badge shows OK / CHECK / BAD; the timeline marks frozen (blue), cut (yellow), glitch (pink), flash (white), black (grey) and flicker (orange) frames. Click it to jump there, or use the skip buttons.\n3. Pin button = output the current frame. Check button = pick_frame -2: the last GOOD frame, for image-to-video continuation.\n4. View menu: jitter shows what changed since the previous frame."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "Ragha Video Inspector\n\n1. Pick a video in Load Video and press Run.\n2. The badge shows OK / CHECK / BAD; the timeline marks frozen (blue), cut (yellow), glitch (pink), flash (white), black (grey) and flicker (orange) frames. Click it to jump there, or use the skip buttons.\n3. Pin button = output the current frame. Check button = pick_frame -2: the last GOOD frame, for image-to-video continuation.\n4. View menu: jitter shows what changed since the previous frame."
      },
